@* MudBlazor's stylesheet resets every button, select and input on the page. The built-in Examples
   use plain HTML controls, as an application without MudBlazor would, so inside them the controls
   are given back the browser's own look. *@
<HeadContent>
    <style>
        .docs-example-builtin :is(button, select, input, textarea, progress):not([class]):not(.ex-pivot *, .ex-grid *) { all: revert; }
        .docs-example-builtin :is(button, select, label):not([class]):not(.ex-pivot *, .ex-grid *) { margin-right: 6px; }
    </style>
</HeadContent>
